[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5051.75, "timestamp": "01:24:11", "text": "我為什麼沒學習"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5062.87, "timestamp": "01:24:22", "text": "？  是的，那是一張紙。  讓你在業界獲得就業機會。是的。  現在我卻在受苦。所以當我看到其他年輕人或像我的同齡人一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5066.87, "timestamp": "01:24:26", "text": "想要獲得學位或想上大學時，我總是告訴他們，是的，不要懈怠。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5087.11, "timestamp": "01:24:47", "text": "別變成我這樣。  你會受苦的。  你好，敘利亞。進來吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5089.99, "timestamp": "01:24:49", "text": "你還是錯了。亡羊補牢，為時未晚。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5095.91, "timestamp": "01:24:55", "text": "我想我還年輕。是的。  當然。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5098.397, "timestamp": "01:24:58", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ohhh that kind my mind went straight to money"}]